  Compilation of the QVC / TEVC preprint: TeX sources, bibliography, figures,
  frozen vacuum and gap-fold numerics, solvers, dictionary and vortex-sector
  codes, crystal structures, and visualization suites. Code under compute/ and
  sim/ is MIT; manuscript, figures, and locked tables are CC BY 4.0. Zenodo
  records the compilation under CC BY 4.0.
